# off-chain/risk_model/artifacts/ is tracked: the registered model hash and
# the deployed verifier are bound to exactly these files.
*.pyc

# EZKL circuit artifacts (Weeks 3-5): regenerate via circuits/build_circuit.py.
# pk.key alone is ~785 MB (rebuilt from kzg.srs by make_proving_key.py), so
# neither belongs in version control. network.compiled, vk.key, proof.json,
# Verifier.sol, and calldata.bytes are small and kept tracked, since they
# let a reviewer verify the pipeline's output without re-running proving.
circuits/pk.key
# circuits/kzg.srs is shipped (8 MB): make_proving_key.py rebuilds pk.key from it
circuits/risk_model.onnx
circuits/model_metadata.json

circuits/risk_model_bound.onnx
